Plugin HerdDataProviders
Plugin HerdAlgorithms
Plugin HerdPersistenceServices
Plugin HerdDataObjects
Plugin Gamma
Plugin Uleg

DataProvider GGSDataProvider ggsDataProvider gamma_sphere.sim.root
  AttachToStore   evStore    event
  AttachToStore   globStore  global

Persistence HerdRootPersistenceService rootPersistence gamma_sphere.dig.root
  Book mcTruth        event evStore
  Book caloHitsMC     event  evStore
  Book caloGeoParams global globStore
  # Book fitHitsCollMC      event  evStore
  Book fitParticleHitsCollMC      event  evStore
  # Book fitHitsCollADC      event  evStore
  # Book fitChannelInfoColl global globStore
  # Book fitParticleHitsCollADC      event  evStore
  Book fitGeoParamsColl global globStore
  # Book scdHitsCollMC      event  evStore
  Book scdGeoParamsColl global globStore
  Book psdHitsCollMC      event  evStore
  Book psdGeoParamsColl global globStore
  # Book fitMatHitsColl event evStore
  Book fitMatHitsCollMC event evStore
  Book fitMatHitsCollNoMainPair event evStore
  Book fitMatHitsCollOnlyMainPair event evStore
  Book fitMatHitsCollNoMainMats event evStore
  Book fitMatHitsCollTh event evStore
  # Book fitMatHitsColl* event evStore
  Book EDep* global globStore
  Book pattern*Map global globStore

EventLoop @@@N_start @@@Nevent
  # Set printModulo 1
  Algo ScdGeometricDigitizerAlgo scdGeomDig
    Set pitch 0.0150
  Algo PsdGeometricDigitizerAlgo psdGeomDig
    # Set topAggrFactorX  4
    # Set topAggrFactorY  4
    # Set latAggrFactorXY 4
    # Set latAggrFactorZ  1
  Algo FitDigitizerAlgo fitDig
    # Set topMatsSize 9.78
    # Set sideShortMatsSize 9.78
    # Set sideLongMatsSize 9.78
    Set nTopMatsPerLayer 12
    Set nSideShortMatsPerLayer 10
    Set nSideLongMatsPerLayer 8
  # Algo FitMatDig fitMatDig
  Algo FitMatDigFromPart fitMatDigFromPart
    Set threshold 1e-4 # in GeV
    Set ignore_neutrons true
  # Algo FitMatDigFromPart fitMatDigFromPartNoMainPair
  #   Set ignore_neutrons true
  #   Set ignore_two true
  #   Set matHitsCollName fitMatHitsCollNoMainPair
  # Algo FitMatDigFromPart fitMatDigFromPartNoMainMats
  #   Set ignore_neutrons true
  #   # Set ignore_two true
  #   Set remove_main_mats true
  #   Set matHitsCollName fitMatHitsCollNoMainMats
  # Algo FitMatDigFromPart fitMatDigFromPartOnlyMainPair
  #   Set ignore_neutrons true
  #   Set only_two true
  #   Set matHitsCollName fitMatHitsCollOnlyMainPair
  #   # Set threshold 1e-4 # in GeV
  # Algo FitMatDigFromPart fitMatDigFromPartTh
  #   Set ignore_neutrons true
  #   Set threshold 1e-4 # in GeV
  #   Set matHitsCollName fitMatHitsCollTh
  # Algo ProduceRoIMap produceRoIMap
  #   Set startLayer 0
  #   Set ignoreIDs {544,546,564,566}
  #   Set dumpPatterns true
  #   Set requireCalo true
